---
title: G. How you get from the thread to each tool
board: 1600x820
---
flowchart LR
  thread([Thread]):::hl
  drawer[Drawer on the phone<br>column on the iPad]:::hl
  picker{Picker<br>empty state or +}
  term[Terminal tab]
  files[Files tab<br>tree + peek]
  changes[Changes tab<br>today's Review]
  termfull[Terminal full screen<br>key row, send to thread]
  fileread[File, reading<br>gutter marks, ±]
  fileedit[File, editing<br>Save = projects.writeFile]
  ws[iPad workspace<br>tree · tabs · terminal · thread]
  mac[(Mac<br>terminal.attach<br>projects.readFile)]:::ext

  thread ==>|1. button or right-edge swipe| drawer
  drawer --> picker
  picker --> term
  picker --> files
  picker --> changes
  term -->|⤢| termfull
  files -->|tap a file, then ⤢| fileread
  fileread -->|Edit| fileedit
  drawer -->|⤢ on iPad| ws
  termfull -.->|select output| thread
  fileread -.->|ask about lines| thread
  term -.- mac
  files -.- mac
